{"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation","title":"Related Documentation"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Patterns","title":"Patterns"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Preview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Preview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"Interaction_Pinch"}]},{"text":"The patch","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"The-patch"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Origami drives this with an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"text":" — a remembered on\/off state — flipped by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a pinch and fed into a Transform Scale. There’s no helper to reach for: it maps straight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"onto native SwiftUI, which is the reusable idea worth taking away. A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MagnifyGesture"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reads the pinch, a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"text":" flag flips at a threshold, and a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".spring"},{"text":" animates the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scale between the two states (see the State\/memory → ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"text":" row in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@State private var popped = false","","RoundedTriangle(cornerRadius: 20)","    .frame(width: 90, height: 80)","    .scaleEffect(popped ? 2 : 1)","    .animation(.spring(response: 0.35, dampingFraction: 0.7), value: popped)","    .gesture(","        MagnifyGesture().onEnded { value in","            if value.magnification > 1.25 { popped = true }","            else if value.magnification < 0.8 { popped = false }","        }","    )"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The pop is the point: a discrete state the gesture toggles, animated with a spring — not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a scale that tracks your fingers continuously.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"How it’s built","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"How-its-built"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The full view sits the white rounded triangle on the magenta artboard and adds a live"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"@GestureState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so the shape follows your fingers mid-pinch before it settles on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"popped state. Read the source (below) for the whole thing."}]},{"text":"Behavior","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Behavior"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch out on the shape to grow it; pinch in to shrink it."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cross the threshold and it snaps to the next size with a spring, rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking your fingers continuously."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The switch remembers its state, so a release between pinches holds the current size."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Downloads","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Downloads"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode sample","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/swamikit.github.io\/swami\/pr-293\/downloads\/Interaction_Pinch.zip","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — the runnable project (same as the button above)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift source","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/swamikit\/swami\/blob\/development\/app\/Swami\/Patterns\/Interaction_Pinch.swift","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — the single source file to read."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Origami source","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/origami.design\/public\/origami_files\/patterns\/Interaction_Pinch.origami"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Pinch a shape to scale it. Past a threshold it pops to an enlarged size with a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spring; pinch back in and it pops home.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinch"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sampleCodeDownload":{"action":{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/swamikit.github.io\/swami\/pr-293\/downloads\/Interaction_Pinch.zip","isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Download Xcode sample"},"kind":"sampleDownload"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"]]},"kind":"article","metadata":{"title":"Interaction — Pinch","images":[{"type":"card","identifier":"Interaction_Pinch.png"}],"modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"roleHeading":"Sample Code","role":"sampleCode"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Pinch"},"references":{"Interaction_Pinch":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/samatwork.Swami\/Interaction_Pinch.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"A white rounded triangle centered on a magenta background. Pinching out springs it to a larger size; pinching in springs it back.","type":"ima